---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Home"
  description="IB Diploma Programme at Súkromné Gymnázium Česká — your journey to academic excellence and personal growth"
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-700 via-emerald-600 to-teal-700 text-white mb-20">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_right,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-white/10 via-transparent to-transparent" />
    <div class="relative px-8 py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
        Your IB Diploma Journey<br />Starts Here
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-emerald-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        At Gymnázium Česká, the IB is more than a qualification — it's a journey
        of discovery. Our teachers guide you to think critically, collaborate
        with purpose, and grow the confidence to shape your future.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What is IB -->
  <section class="mb-20">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="bg-stone-100 rounded-3xl h-72 sm:h-80 lg:h-96 flex items-center justify-center border border-stone-200">
        <div class="text-center text-stone-400">
          <svg class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-3 opacity-30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1" d="M12 14l6.16-3.422a12.083 12.083 0 01.665 6.479A11.952 11.952 0 0012 20.055a11.952 11.952 0 00-6.824-2.998 12.078 12.078 0 01.665-6.479L12 14z"/></svg>
          <p class="text-sm">Photo / illustration area</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-emerald-700">What is the IB?</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2 mb-4 tracking-tight">
          A global standard for <span class="text-emerald-700">curious minds</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
          The International Baccalaureate (IB) is a rigorous, internationally
          recognised educational framework taught in over 5,500 schools across
          160 countries. At its heart is a commitment to developing inquiring,
          knowledgeable, and caring young people who are motivated to succeed.
        </p>
        <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mt-3">
          At Súkromné Gymnázium Česká, we offer the IB curriculum to prepare
          students for university and beyond — combining academic depth with
          personal growth and community engagement.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MYP vs DP -->
  <section class="mb-20">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-emerald-700">Programmes</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2 tracking-tight">Two stages, <span class="text-emerald-700">one journey</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- MYP -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-8 sm:p-10 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Middle Years Programme <span class="text-amber-600 font-medium">(MYP)</span></h3>
        <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          For students aged 11 to 16, the MYP builds a strong academic
          foundation while encouraging students to make practical connections
          between their studies and the real world.
        </p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-stone-500 space-y-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
            8 subject groups with interdisciplinary learning
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
            Personal project in the final year
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
            Service as action — community engagement
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
            Prepares the mindset for the Diploma Programme
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- DP -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-8 sm:p-10 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Diploma Programme <span class="text-emerald-600 font-medium">(DP)</span></h3>
        <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          For students aged 16 to 19, the DP is a two-year, academically
          challenging programme that leads to the IB Diploma — a qualification
          respected by universities worldwide.
        </p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-stone-500 space-y-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
            6 subject groups at Higher or Standard Level
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
            Theory of Knowledge (TOK) course
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
            Extended Essay — 4,000-word research paper
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
            Creativity, Activity, Service (CAS)
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Explore Sections -->
  <section class="mb-20">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-emerald-700">Explore</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2 tracking-tight">Everything you need, <span class="text-emerald-700">one place</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <a href="/subjects"
        class="group rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors">Subjects</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-500">Browse IB subjects across all 6 groups, with syllabi and teacher info.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/cas"
        class="group rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors">CAS</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-500">Creativity, Activity, Service — student projects and learning outcomes.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/tok"
        class="group rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors">TOK</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-500">Theory of Knowledge — essays, themes, and critical thinking materials.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/ee"
        class="group rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors">Extended Essay</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-500">Guide to the 4,000-word research paper — timeline, resources, and samples.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/news"
        class="group rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M19 20H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h10a2 2 0 012 2v1m2 13a2 2 0 01-2-2V7m2 13a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2m-4-3H9M7 16h6M7 8h6v4H7V8z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors">News</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-500">Announcements, exam schedules, and important programme updates.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
